{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cardinal Descent is a card building roguelike where you craft elemental synergies and find game breaking sticker combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically play element based cards to pull off combos of your choosing. Play your cards in the right order to maximise damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/extras/elements.gif?t=1749074895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Change the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress you unlock game changing stickers that are placed on your cards, find cool synergies and combos as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/extras/stickers.gif?t=1749074895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Break The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sticker editing and the shop allow you to craft the perfect synergy to deal insane amounts of damage. Will you break the game? Or will it outpace you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/extras/combo.gif?t=1749074895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Element based card combat system, with the basic element types (Lightning, Water, Fire, Earth) included for the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">90 hand picked stickers showcasing a taste of different play styles for the larger game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ example demo boss enemies\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 'System' to give you an idea of how the game is played</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 room subtypes to demonstrate some of the potential deck building upgrades available\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic soundtrack, with 3 sample tracks\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, 5 min tutorial to get you to understand the larger game fully\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juicy UI</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792470?t=1749074895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/ced9328419a73f0f6c0aa6786f1f70ce3a379be1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749074895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/6bc64e00039016e676dd3dfd97946c9d57777a32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749074895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/6bc64e00039016e676dd3dfd97946c9d57777a32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749074895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cardinal Descent is a card building roguelike where you craft elemental synergies and find game breaking sticker combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically play element based cards to pull off combos of your choosing. Play your cards in the right order to maximise damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/extras/elements.gif?t=1749074895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Change the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress you unlock game changing stickers that are placed on your cards, find cool synergies and combos as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/extras/stickers.gif?t=1749074895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Break The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sticker editing and the shop allow you to craft the perfect synergy to deal insane amounts of damage. Will you break the game? Or will it outpace you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/extras/combo.gif?t=1749074895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Element based card combat system, with the basic element types (Lightning, Water, Fire, Earth) included for the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">90 hand picked stickers showcasing a taste of different play styles for the larger game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ example demo boss enemies\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 'System' to give you an idea of how the game is played</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 room subtypes to demonstrate some of the potential deck building upgrades available\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic soundtrack, with 3 sample tracks\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, 5 min tutorial to get you to understand the larger game fully\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juicy UI</p></li></ul>","developers":["Liam Flannery"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3114100","name":"Cardinal Descent"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792470/b9367487604b562a912877d57b9ee79667ee15a8/header.jpg?t=1749074895","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257149782,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149782/movie480.mp4?t=1749074535","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149782